  "wiki": {
    "extract": "Jes\u00fas Garc\u00eda Corona was a Mexican railroad brakeman who died while preventing a train loaded with dynamite from exploding near Nacozari, Sonora, in 1907. As \"el h\u00e9roe de Nacozari\", he is revered as a national hero and many streets, plazas, and schools across Mexico are named after him.",
